<title>BELGIUM: IBEL BUYS UCO SHARES FROM PARENT.</title>
<headline>IBEL BUYS UCO SHARES FROM PARENT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Ibel NV said on Friday it had acquired a block of 280,740 shares in textile firm Uco Textiles from its parent company Cobepa, lifting its stake to 50.83 percent.</p>
<p>The price paid was around one billion Belgian francs, it said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
